    <div class="aside-card">
      <div class="aside-title">Common questions</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Do I need to know Notion well to use your templates?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">No. Every template includes a Loom walkthrough and setup guide. If you can duplicate a Notion page, you can use them.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Do you offer refunds?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Yes — 30-day guarantee, no questions asked. If you set it up and it genuinely doesn't deliver value, email me.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Can I use the templates with multiple clients?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Absolutely. You buy once and duplicate as many times as you need. That's the whole point.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Do you do custom Notion builds?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Yes, for agencies whose needs go beyond what the templates cover. Start with a free audit call.</div>
        </div>
